==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|en|react|ance}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|physics|electrics}} The [[opposition]] to the change in [[flow]] of current in an [[alternating current]] circuit, due to [[inductance]] and [[capacitance]]; the [[imaginary]] part of the [[impedance]]. Symbol: ''[[X]]''.
# A similar effect in [[magnetism]].
# {{lb|en|psychology}} An [[emotional]] reaction in direct [[contradiction]] to rules or [[regulations]] that threaten or eliminate specific [[behavioral]] freedoms.

